WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
What’s left after drying in sea water may not be edible directly.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,520
His soup has no bitter taste at all

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,480
There must be some processing

4
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:06,740
How do you know if you haven't passed by?

5
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,860
So figure it out first

6
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:15,680
Don't blow the cow out to eat first.

7
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:22,160
Those fish of yours will be eaten later. Brother Su Che, it’s just the right time for us to come to work.

8
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,080
A sheepskin

9
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,240
One hangs the meat on the smoked duck

10
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,020
Don't be too happy. Finish eating before eating. You know.

11
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:39,830
The grilled fish we have over there is nothing like this.

12
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,430
Xue Ya also said every day that she would survive

13
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:42,350
Judge others less

14
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,150
What you eat today is your own wages.
